Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"157.207.0.126","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79397,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1436973525,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9fd89a0945420131041ee6c470633a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My fiance&#039; and I are going to be getting married early next year, but don&#039;t want to wait. &amp;nbsp;We&#039;d like to skip on down to Cancun or similar in the next month or so and have a small ceremony with just the two of us. &amp;nbsp;This would allow us to do a couple things we&#039;re really excited about. &amp;nbsp;First, we&#039;re just ready to be man and wife, but my fiance would also like to wear something a little too risque for our families. &amp;nbsp;We can have vows that include things that may not be suitable for our children as well (we have 6 total). &amp;nbsp;There&#039;s no getting around the big formal wedding or some of our family would kill us, but this would allow us to have the best of both worlds. &amp;nbsp;It would just be the two of us and something simple on the beach is all we need. &amp;nbsp;No wedding cake, chairs, etc. &amp;nbsp;Just an officiator, photographer and the sand between our toes. &amp;nbsp;If anyone has any good suggestions, please let me know.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Obviously, with 6 kids, the budget isn&#039;t huge. &amp;nbsp;We don&#039;t need a $1000 package that has everything we don&#039;t need.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900523,"PostDate":1436973453,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My fiance' and I are going to be getting married early next year, but don't want to wait. \u00a0We'd like to skip on down to Cancun or similar in the next month or so and have a small ceremony with just the two of us. \u00a0This would allow us to do a couple things we're really excited about. \u00a0First, we're just ready to be man and wife, but my fiance would also like to wear something a little too risque for our families. \u00a0We can have vows that include things that may not be suitable for our children as well (we have 6 total). \u00a0There's no getting around the big formal wedding or some of our family would kill us, but this would allow us to have the best of both worlds. \u00a0It would just be the two of us and something simple on the beach is all we need. \u00a0No wedding cake, chairs, etc. \u00a0Just an officiator, photographer and the sand between our toes. \u00a0If anyone has any good suggestions, please let me know.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Obviously, with 6 kids, the budget isn't huge. \u00a0We don't need a $1000 package that has everything we don't need.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dave@thehaberers.com","IpAddress":"157.207.0.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436973244,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jonyah","Id":283978,"Name":"jonyah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.19.134.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79397,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"883b7a8314330671a852a1e88dcb3410","RawContent":"Hi. Congratulations! My FI and I are eloping! Decided on Hideaway at Royalton Riviera Cancun. They do a &#039;Just the two of us &#039; package for $449 just need a photographer then. Their on site photographers package starts from $650 for 1.5hrs and 30 photos x\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1900653,"PostDate":1437141478,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi. Congratulations! My FI and I are eloping! Decided on Hideaway at Royalton Riviera Cancun. They do a 'Just the two of us ' package for $449 just need a photographer then. Their on site photographers package starts from $650 for 1.5hrs and 30 photos x<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.39.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79397,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1830691b9f26497bceb5e0ecef1f42ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community jonyah and Congrats on your upcoming nuptials!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve captured a very tasteful Couples&#039; Photo Shoot which you may find interesting. Here&#039;s the link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151655457749487.1073741855.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Romeo &amp;amp; Juliette Photo Session&lt;\/a&gt; with some excerpts here.....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1014849_10151655458399487_414217091_o.jpg\" alt=\"1014849_10151655458399487_414217091_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1040373_10151655459394487_1953106545_o.jpg\" alt=\"1040373_10151655459394487_1953106545_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1040298_10151655459939487_338450873_o.jpg\" alt=\"1040298_10151655459939487_338450873_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find all the answers you&#039;re looking for, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902216,"PostDate":1439203361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community jonyah and Congrats on your upcoming nuptials!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've captured a very tasteful Couples' Photo Shoot which you may find interesting. Here's the link: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151655457749487.1073741855.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Romeo & Juliette Photo Session<\/a> with some excerpts here.....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1014849_10151655458399487_414217091_o.jpg\" alt=\"1014849_10151655458399487_414217091_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1040373_10151655459394487_1953106545_o.jpg\" alt=\"1040373_10151655459394487_1953106545_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1040298_10151655459939487_338450873_o.jpg\" alt=\"1040298_10151655459939487_338450873_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find all the answers you're looking for, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
